    {
      "q": "How can I get an Opal card?",
      "a": "You can get an adult or child/youth Opal card, or a concession Opal card.",
      "link": null
    },
    {
      "q": "How do I top up my Opal card?",
      "a": "You can top up your Opal card at a top up machine, an Opal card seller, on the Opal Travel app, or online.",
      "link": null
    },
    {
      "q": "What can I do with my Opal card online?",
